cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the run records, please cite the article below."
title: "Train once, deploy across hospitals? Code and run records"
abstract: >-
  Domain-complete, seed-replicated evaluation of distribution-shift methods in
  computational pathology on four public cohorts (Camelyon17-WILDS, multi-scanner
  canine cSCC, MIDOG 2021, MIDOG++) at two model scales, with the records of all
  4,778 training runs, the variance-decomposition, power and rank-stability code,
  and the scripts that regenerate every table and figure of the article.
